-- An entry is stored in several file segments and served from them
1	1
QueryCacheOnDiskHits	1
QueryCacheOnDiskMisses	1
-- Two more entries push the first one out of the cache: it is a miss and is written again
QueryCacheOnDiskHits	1
QueryCacheOnDiskMisses	3
-- An entry bigger than the whole cache is not stored, the query still works
10000
10000
QueryCacheOnDiskMisses	2
-- An entry which does not fit into the probationary queue of an SLRU cache is not stored and leaves no file segments behind
0
QueryCacheOnDiskMisses	2
-- SYSTEM DROP FILESYSTEM CACHE removes the entries
0
QueryCacheOnDiskHits	1
QueryCacheOnDiskMisses	2
